<contentList>
	<content contentuid="h27c5ff2fgd70dg4e71ga8dag4c73148e6fcb" version="1">The flail of pain is a weapon blessed by Loviatar capable of inflicting holy wrath on enemies.  Great power comes at a price though and the user must pay a penance to earns Loviatar's blessings.</content>
	<content contentuid="h7985721cg9edcg4f19gae2eg48afb32970ee" version="1">Flail of Pain</content>
	<content contentuid="hcd4dd757g77cag49beg968fgec5334c1d997" version="1">Forged by Drow elves in Menzobarranzen this blade poisons anything it touches, the wielder however is granted immunity from poison.</content>
	<content contentuid="h2ed2b143g8696g4b10gaaadg63abaf5c36bf" version="1">Venom</content>
	<content contentuid="h69edb82bgd94ag431ag9e8egca2532cceb04" version="1">A dagger designed to incapacitate enemies swiftly by imbuing a mixture of chemicals and magic into the blade.</content>
	<content contentuid="h47610189g5aa5g4fc7gaca0g3fef656d5b7f" version="1">Crippling Dagger</content>
	<content contentuid="h830a3855g6353g490fg93e9g4972ef433d95" version="1">A magical hand crossbow that is able shoot much further and with greater force than normal.</content>
	<content contentuid="h61fe2181g3befg4205g820bg528b19c5dd0d" version="1">Crossbow of Great Range</content>
	<content contentuid="h2f898868g5517g49bfg84acg709f42341b53" version="1">A magical hand crossbow that is able to imbue magic into the bolts it fires.</content>
	<content contentuid="h21451838geb2fg493fgb7cdgf3ce8ef989f4" version="1">Crossbow of Many Bolts</content>
	<content contentuid="h6a44a60agb6d5g4376g954ag282e3ab28765" version="1">A magical shield capable of reducing the damage from attacks.</content>
	<content contentuid="h55984cd6gd666g477dg8ffcgad02cdbdfc83" version="1">Shield of Blocking</content>
	<content contentuid="h1a0532c6g6c3ag4516g94d8g0f1f07e6f844" version="1">Suspicious Bag</content>
	<content contentuid="h73f90216g71aag46ecg919eg573811ccff6d" version="1">Repeating Crossbow</content>
	<content contentuid="hf66ea2bag1606g4b0cg9c87g8ce6158ccfa5" version="1">This heavy crossbow can be loaded with extra bolts to unleash a devastating salvo.  It is also possible to overtighten the mechanism to enable greater range and damage but there is a risk that the weapon could backfire when being overtightened. The crossbow can be loaded or overtightened before combat to save time.</content>
	<content contentuid="he89d30bfg9805g4005ga28ege355e1cb7456" version="1">Dragon Blade</content>
	<content contentuid="h655022a9g5933g406bga09ag1cb25292e1b5" version="1">The blade of this weapon is incredibly light but too hot to touch, almost as if it is made of dragon fire itself.  Fortunately the wielder is granted a great deal of protection from fire damage.  Bound to a red dragon the sword allows it's wielder to summon the dragon in times of need.</content>
	<content contentuid="hefe2da47g9b4fg40fdga900ga3e4c1ab6d03" version="1">Hungering Hammer</content>
	<content contentuid="h8bbf8c86gb8f9g442ega4acg929cc45a995d" version="1">This cursed warhammer craves violence and drives you to fulfill it's desires.</content>
	<content contentuid="h44978df8g1338g42b6ga5d1g6f6de5aa2ae9" version="1">Wearing this ring fills you with energy.</content>
	<content contentuid="h6f8f8c94g94e5g456bg96eag1160011e7513" version="1">Ring of Power</content>
	<content contentuid="h7163c6d1gb2ffg42a0gbfa5g2fbef86e258b" version="1">Doom Axe</content>
	<content contentuid="hac183187g3d25g47f5g8c34gf5dfe201a57a" version="1">This axe exudes necrotic energy crippling those unlucky enough to be hit by it.</content>
	<content contentuid="hd13a1311g81bfg41bcgb640ge442984803f4" version="1">Sword of Ice</content>
	<content contentuid="hf31cf50egd979g49a7g8914g6f5f8d140972" version="1">This great sword draws heat from it's surroundings and chills anything it touches.  Some of the heat drawn into the blade is given to the wielder protecting them from cold and stopping the wielder from slipping on the frozen ground around them.</content>
	<content contentuid="hebd0ca34gffd9g4125g9d08g277e1888bf9e" version="1">This shield flickers with energy repelling projectiles.</content>
	<content contentuid="had856bc9gb3dbg4692gbaccg5d80ae89ed4d" version="1">Shield of Deflection</content>
	<content contentuid="h40f310bfga9eag4e2dgafb2gbbda7055f0a5" version="1">This staff gives off waves of healing energy that will heal anything it touches.  However the power of the staff will also exhaust the target putting them to sleep.  The staff refuses to inflict harm on others.</content>
	<content contentuid="hfba19e38g54a2g45fbgab53gccca58709beb" version="1">Staff of Slumber</content>
	<content contentuid="h47e78c13gfe4dg49a5gb448g667ece0dd387" version="1">Epheremal Backpack </content>
	<content contentuid="he5a01f23g01e3g4c0fg94eeg28a62ae7f5fc" version="1">This backpack doesn't seem to be entirely in this realm and appears to be slowly fading back to whence it came, the contents however seem to be stable.</content>
	<content contentuid="h6abb7e57ga0d0g4607gbb1bg42085489c8fd" version="1">Bag of Bows</content>
	<content contentuid="h6afa41b4g5926g41e6ga3f7ga3584478e5a7" version="1">This bag holds some seriously deadly ranged weapons.</content>
	<content contentuid="hbbbbdd2ag8fe4g479agabcagaf81fb744cb9" version="1">Bag of Weapons</content>
	<content contentuid="h5c37fc93g0732g428dg9016g02170532a527" version="1">This bag hold all sorts of melee weapons.</content>
	<content contentuid="ha7c5ed97ga89fg4a25g8411g1079e6c9c5aa" version="1">Bag of Armour</content>
	<content contentuid="h5c312613g25ddg4770gb01ag4edeb3f147c8" version="1">This rather heavy bag is brim full of magnificent armour.</content>
	<content contentuid="h6dbf415eg8f98g45dagbf41gf8f89f0b6e40" version="1">You can see fire twisting within the jewels on this ring as if trying to escape, if you hold it tightly you may be able to release this energy.</content>
	<content contentuid="hd62e5540g163fg4a95gb9cag4660ba613356" version="1">Ring of Fire</content>
	<content contentuid="he334c657gf590g41c0gb6fagfbe3704f8215" version="1">You can see frost twisting within the jewels on this ring as if trying to escape, if you hold it tightly you may be able to release this energy.</content>
	<content contentuid="hb2b9bb20gb303g404bg897eg97d9c03be65e" version="1">Ring of Ice</content>
	<content contentuid="640ecace42414c6ea9b810ccdf5ff3d2" version="1">You can see fire twisting within the jewels on this ring as if trying to escape, if you hold it tightly you may be able to release this energy.</content>
	<content contentuid="8320c56665444329b4d940566c11add7" version="1">Empowered Ring of Fire</content>
	<content contentuid="09f05206ee90486bade43eff33d1a5b4" version="1">You can see frost twisting within the jewels on this ring as if trying to escape, if you hold it tightly you may be able to release this energy.</content>
	<content contentuid="524b30daaa4340019f38928b2d3040a1" version="1">Empowered Ring of Ice</content>
	<content contentuid="h972be674ga19eg43b7ga928g3b3ab6d62a74" version="1">Thorned Circlet of Healing</content>
	<content contentuid="h9c14c263g834cg4918g9a13gbdb1baa29844" version="1">This circlet has sharp thorns that point outwards, you can see that they can however twist inwards in some circumstances.</content>
	<content contentuid="h948a7104gc50dg4af7gacd1gea13dcc6890a" version="1">This armour has been blessed by Shar, if you look closely you can see shadows moving through it.</content>
	<content contentuid="h08a6549dg5a5eg443dga7e2gc6a18b70a01b" version="1">Sharmour</content>
	<content contentuid="0ab87731-efa2-4a15-8db1-71f096ae078c" version="1">This glaive thrums with power, once per short rest it can be released in a devasting thunderclap.</content>
	<content contentuid="67eff79a-5e6e-4f44-b459-d75178e7ad10" version="1">Thunderous Glaive</content>
	<content contentuid="b9ef77a5-8d37-4b86-bd9a-f9eb94d17897" version="1">These gloves have magically enhanced grip.</content>
	<content contentuid="40ca8594-3f83-49c8-9a11-7eecee54a707" version="1">Grippy Gloves</content>
