	<content contentuid="7d59d3bce3e744af82ae0bfc18c09b89" version="1">Make a pact with Erythnul, you may choose what manner of slaughter you partake in to earn rewards.</content>
	<content contentuid="c7d8543fb79748b7a15db060dc732568" version="1">Bite</content>
	<content contentuid="a17dc6dbe50341d6a77a8aa2ab9f2f67" version="1">Bite a chunk out of a nearby enemy and regain health</content>
	<content contentuid="b3e0518caed349a1a8946172ddb5b88e" version="1">Staff of Slumber Heal</content>
	<content contentuid="d205bf93cbdf4eda8e449e50386b9b44" version="1">Direct the energies from the staff of slumber to heal</content>
	<content contentuid="5dda6f9f517c41fb838f6e846cd9a8bc" version="1">Staff of Slumber Resurrection</content>
	<content contentuid="f6a1a639d0ef4b11a3989f891a8db111" version="1">Use the power within the staff to resurrect a fallen ally</content>
