	<content contentuid="42d7fc4f750e4e569bac9ee83f50d5b1" version="1">Fire rages within you</content>
	<content contentuid="ed76926f04fe4b8cbd56ba5580bcf5b5" version="1">Ring of Fire</content>
	<content contentuid="1671e0e8754b4a798c3aa3e9836a2fdc" version="1">The fire burns</content>
	<content contentuid="51d0329ddd2744569d3c3d8bbfe6faed" version="1">Ring of Ice</content>
	<content contentuid="f604ee8f588641a48968f600878a3464" version="1">Cold rages within you</content>
	<content contentuid="b2bd0c636dd34c439ce178eb1283ce87" version="1">Ring of Ice</content>
	<content contentuid="44133bb43a644021b3ffcbc5ccfb84f7" version="1">So... cold....</content>
	<content contentuid="1ca905d07c3f4b86b3fff924c444c8ba" version="1">Thorned Circlet of Healing</content>
	<content contentuid="3c4d3c1b2d87437eba88d5a241a7ce80" version="1">Slowly restoring life.</content>
	<content contentuid="9ddf82deabed4e368a601a801b519a60" version="1">Thorned Circlet of Healing</content>
	<content contentuid="23ec199180684698adbc9c35c8371a1c" version="1">As a result of your actions the thorns turn inwards...</content>
	<content contentuid="bf3580346a6347f98b0a5931d224040c" version="1">Thunderous Glaive</content>
	<content contentuid="b66bd299e1a24434a342f4623964c467" version="1">Release the energy within the glaive in a tremendous schockwave.</content>
	<content contentuid="6b586c2481144493b82ec3b51d007842" version="1">Fire Breath</content>
	<content contentuid="ad86e1fe7f1145bfadd1d0b9e535f32b" version="1">Spew a torrent of dragon flame.</content>
	<content contentuid="73fb866002f3412fa09b965bd26c2079" version="1">Swipe</content>
	<content contentuid="2ca7c745e9264aea8d3f8d75fa216cc9" version="1">Swipe your claws in front of you.</content>
	<content contentuid="4e9cdd55c5ab4eec84bd84b9bfcfcc2f" version="1">Summon Dragon</content>
	<content contentuid="927645a7de29422a868c2d3ef82f7993" version="1">Summon a red dragon to aid you.</content>
	<content contentuid="a8bf88ed9d9940aaa7d21d8359d7f836" version="1">Activate Ring of Fire</content>
	<content contentuid="8765a2af9e2542cab5acf3f6276412fa" version="1">Activate your ring of fire to incinerate your enemies.</content>
	<content contentuid="395b54ff38d6497d89204a3f9d1f05a4" version="1">Activate Ring of Ice</content>
	<content contentuid="8608dbb6b44846dc8dffdedbf68d7bcc" version="1">Activate your ring to unleash frozen death upon your enemies.</content>
	<content contentuid="d4a2ac8c7447459390b3e7122eea355b" version="1">Thorned Circlet of Healing</content>
	<content contentuid="5a6ce858e53643709943c03123c28716" version="1">Slowly restores life over time.</content>
	<content contentuid="23ff214562d5426785a15316fe1b1a66" version="1">Loviatar's Gift</content>
	<content contentuid="8898048a0361401ba043e18956b6ba79" version="1">Prove you are worthy of Loviatar's blessing.</content>
	<content contentuid="d978478dc1124b3a802a78ee865251aa" version="1">Loviatar's Punishment</content>
	<content contentuid="285b4b6f75db49559ecf2050edab2e8a" version="1">Those who have proven themselves worthy may release Loviatar's wrath upon their enemies.</content>
	<content contentuid="1450b51eb4754b1ab2bce426c16ab630" version="1">Reload Repeating Crossbow</content>
	<content contentuid="69c87e421f8345b18100ff3a473cdb03" version="1">Load additional bolts into the crossbow to prepare a huge volley.  This is a time consuming process so it is a good idea to do this before entering combat.</content>
	<content contentuid="67ef7d608f5440d5ab6dd5e0c2c796e8" version="1">Overtighten Repeating Crossbow</content>
	<content contentuid="d141b00c67d046caad939e7fbe3f783e" version="1">Overtighten the firing mechanism to shoot further and hit harder.  There is a chance that this could backfire though.</content>
	<content contentuid="afc7efc25ba54c5d9744c1c37c05d7bf" version="1">Crossbow of Many Bolts</content>
	<content contentuid="f23193db7df34457aeac0997177a2fe0" version="1">This legendary crossbow can create magical arrows when you draw your fire it.</content>
	<content contentuid="76aceba076e04158921d023ad3311ea0" version="1">Repeating Crossbow Salvo</content>
	<content contentuid="e27aac3c71e74990a2948d7c4b95ea56" version="1">Fire a salvo of bolts to hit multiple enemies.</content>
	<content contentuid="e596bcfb10f546b2872f6e141ccd20bb" version="1">Overtightened Crossbow Shot</content>
	<content contentuid="8b075485b196487a925064f1228112ac" version="1">Fire a devastating long range shot.</content>
	<content contentuid="0b0388ede3ae481fa33e03fd9054c642" version="1">Concentrated dragon flame</content>
	<content contentuid="7f6a9721c9fe429495e27a2fb21d095c" version="1">Spit a glob of dragon flame that will create an incredibly hot surface.</content>
	<content contentuid="3971dcb094954a698673c4cbf9946959" version="1">Scorching Blast</content>
	<content contentuid="fb909531b59e4e4b97afe48ca0e60c8e" version="1">Spew multiple blasts of fire.</content>
	<content contentuid="dd97092912a04fb0b4fb385852fcf9cc" version="1">Hungering Hammer</content>
	<content contentuid="51a40328ed1947638744fe520f9052b1" version="1">The hammer craves blood filling you with its rage and need for violence.</content>
	<content contentuid="23eb422c495d4f39a967aa151ccd220c" version="1">Sharmour</content>
	<content contentuid="7dc4dce44f12449ea80918f469af0333" version="1">Darkness runs through you.</content>
	<content contentuid="75923a9aad3c4651a1905d018130bffe" version="1">Thorned Circlet</content>
	<content contentuid="e1ccf8afbd224f0bbde263b239094ca1" version="1">Razor sharp thorns surround your head.</content>
	<content contentuid="83a5bdcae290463d86c55c73767465e8" version="1">Thorned Circlet</content>
	<content contentuid="ad18bbc9a19c4c1ca424e0c258d37852" version="1">Razor sharp thorns surround your head.</content>
	<content contentuid="39579f9ebd014233b655ff8ccf81c8d0" version="1">Ring of Fire</content>
	<content contentuid="289c7d76993949da87c1f6c9112b776a" version="1">Fire burns within you.</content>
	<content contentuid="c152de6c3dd946838363c179c47d59b6" version="1">Ring of Ice</content>
	<content contentuid="08fc1374ff8b45789faab85a1d32e95a" version="1">Ice fills your veins.</content>
	<content contentuid="c1954b6612be42e88371b9cdb4a5ac74" version="1">Summon Lava Elemental</content>
	<content contentuid="b7e227feb3df43d8b8dbf1915a7a5124" version="1">Summon a lava elemental to fight for you.</content>
	<content contentuid="ed7df05e20314dacbd3187667882166d" version="1">Ability Ring</content>
	<content contentuid="e4df611e3ed84877b815157a57fa3e9c" version="1">A ring imbued with phenomenal power.</content>
	<content contentuid="f4ddfc394d7c4fa99b47cf36dc93bf6b" version="1">Cutting Scimitar</content>
	<content contentuid="29f08f418a774ece911994e0d9d51d81" version="1">This blade is able to expose the targets weaknesses to deliver devestating blows.</content>
	<content contentuid="9561e4e833c6498daa00818fcba58737" version="1">Expose Weakness</content>
	<content contentuid="175c7398295443a9b50e24e28354b6d2" version="1">The scimitar probes the target exposing their weaknesses.</content>
	<content contentuid="2b3e4d352ca4493a99f58d259e0279fc" version="1">Exposed Weakness</content>
	<content contentuid="39c9340675514ed78d7fb040fdeab95d" version="1">Taking increased damage from slashing attacks.</content>
	<content contentuid="e6e2dfcbddf34dc2873d5823728fe27f" version="1">Sharp Ring</content>
	<content contentuid="11d608d01ae14d238f7c2388aa99430d" version="1">A ring set with an incredibly sharp stone that is oddly difficult to focus on. This would probably hurt a lot if someone were to punch you while wearing it. Reduces the roll required for an unarmed critical strike by 3 (this effect stacks).</content>
	<content contentuid="5f00df15d4a042fd925cf0dd4f87fe78" version="1">Staff of Lolth</content>
	<content contentuid="2644b687cae24469ba063645c541a403" version="1">This staff has been imbued with power by Lolth herself allowing the user to temporarily gain Lolths blessing transforming into one of her chosen.</content>
	<content contentuid="b494ebebfd3541a7aca7d45e74c680aa" version="1">Blessings of Lolth</content>
	<content contentuid="5cfe64a53c8945adbf17152dfd57a45a" version="1">Use the power inmbue in the staff to receive a blessing from Lolth.</content>
	<content contentuid="f5fccc8eb1be41c8aeb6829438cb8141" version="1">Relinquish Spider form.</content>
	<content contentuid="f7354672354b40d0b4983726dee79bf4" version="1">Return to your true form.</content>
	<content contentuid="41864d1a81274078bf0e1b580bea4ac5" version="1">Blessing of Lolth, Giant Spider</content>
	<content contentuid="40f8030e34a740259037b0fe62d8308e" version="1">Allow Lolths power to flow through you and transform into a Giant Spider.</content>
	<content contentuid="61bad08ca8bc4d31abefbd8376b7cf38" version="1">Blessing of Lolth, Small Spider</content>
	<content contentuid="5695b27b7c2a405692f5616d2cd25dec" version="1">Allow Lolths power to flow through you and transform into a Small Spider.</content>
	<content contentuid="2fc51cc7e3fc42b8a5240964f8a6073b" version="1">Blessing of Lolth, Queen Spider</content>
	<content contentuid="e180217e0b9d4cbd94abd1edcfb779b1" version="1">Allow Lolths power to flow through you and transform into a Queen Spider.</content>
	<content contentuid="982a551ddb664701aa003d48db95c805" version="1">Blessing of Lolth, Giant Spider</content>
	<content contentuid="dbcfb735d16e4dcebad572cb41b6df3d" version="1">Blessing of Lolth, Small Spider</content>
	<content contentuid="4d7ac9f1742b42d1885f82df2db5cb85" version="1">Blessing of Lolth, Queen Spider</content>
	<content contentuid="a8c29a7ce225482e81f017d10373a176" version="1">Lolth's Small Snare</content>
	<content contentuid="87353af88f1846c68b68f8a30f69961b" version="1">Cast a small web to ensare enemies.</content>
	<content contentuid="3ea2e9b678e74edab8746a2abdd1d01a" version="1">Lolth's Large Snare</content>
	<content contentuid="7535f7286fa64f2aa51ad8a9e2d74408" version="1">Cast a large web to ensare enemies.</content>
	<content contentuid="e04dbefe5bb6497ab329980315cc2283" version="1">Cloak of Flight</content>
	<content contentuid="df8dc1417eca412189e5d5769a847f3f" version="1">This magical cloak allows flight and protects the wearer from falling.</content>
	<content contentuid="9ccd6595ccee49da8559ec1d7f18a0a4" version="1">Dark Pact - Rampage</content>
	<content contentuid="77e2bb4fb6b54f13903c7bff7012f735" version="1">Enter a pact with Erythnul agreeing to go on a rampage slaughtering those you encounter.</content>
	<content contentuid="5581b4fe709b4dc4af59b175382dfca4" version="1">Dark Pact - Tier 1</content>
	<content contentuid="646ea5bc9cb247919df78d2d717b0877" version="1">Enter a pact with Erythnul agreeing to fight a first tier enemy, if you prevail you will be rewarded.</content>
	<content contentuid="bf17c627ff0f41c99b866ca161e1a94a" version="1">Dark Pact - Tier 2</content>
	<content contentuid="3100381e758f44268af9c0cdbbb2f38f" version="1">Enter a pact with Erythnul agreeing to fight a second tier enemy, if you prevail you will be rewarded.</content>
	<content contentuid="d4365dcc8fa643deae51dae4c9fe4994" version="1">Dark Pact - Tier 3</content>
	<content contentuid="3040c2d4a06948fdb638ce340f2ef7b7" version="1">Enter a pact with Erythnul agreeing to fight a third tier enemy, if you prevail you will be rewarded. Be warned, this battle will be challenging.</content>
	<content contentuid="fba5f6ba087942bb88bda7bf9bfa9695" version="1">Dark Pact - Tier 4</content>
	<content contentuid="5840ef47d6924773af0db6ef3e0fdd3b" version="1">Enter a pact with Erythnul agreeing to fight a fourth tier enemy, if you prevail you will be rewarded. Be warned, this battle will be incredibly dangerous.</content>
	<content contentuid="09424bca87dc40aaa57212fa8ec650fa" version="1">Legendary Loot</content>
