	<content contentuid="36f222aed81e4d879f910e03810f8fbf" version="1">Impossibly Forceful Explosion</content>
	<content contentuid="f60216f546ea41d88fb2e0fea10afbf0" version="1">When an unstoppable force meets an immovable object nothing good will happen.</content>
	<content contentuid="a0cca0af20ca4e26bdba96c84d6fee8a" version="1">Unstoppable Force</content>
	<content contentuid="9075a8d90b2e4184be57e8ce8ea6947b" version="1">The unstoppable force is just that, it completely ignores any bludgeoning resistance.</content>
	<content contentuid="92feece638f441559ddd14f08be88eef" version="1">The Unstoppable Force</content>
	<content contentuid="1a10fd641d2243f091d89ca7dfa292fd" version="1">This hammer is unstoppable completely ignoring the targets bludgeoning resistance... that is so long as the target is not an immovable object.</content>
	<content contentuid="d5fb7a309ccc41e39f766ea5a63cf0d7" version="1">The Immovable Object</content>
	<content contentuid="56a7f5189607448e9062b87953a09f8e" version="1">This Immovable Object provides complete immunity to bludgeoning damage, so long as it isn't hit by an unstoppable force.</content>
